      "writtenOn": "2021-06-03T22:15:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Change the name to PLATFORM_EC_CROS_BOARD_INFO_VIRTUAL, then you won\u0027t need to add an entry into the allow list.\n\nPLATFORM_EC_CBI was added before we had a script to verify new config options also create a Kconfig entry.\n\nThis EEPROM CBI and Virtual CBI options should also be organized as a Kconfig \"choice\" so that only one option can be enabled.\n\ne.g\n\nconfig PLATFORM_EC_CBI\n    bool \"Chromium OS Board Info (CBI) Support\"\n    \nif PLATFORM_EC_CBI\n   \nchoice \"CBI Type\"\n\nconfig PLATFORM_EC_CROS_BOARD_INFO\n    bool \"CBI EEPROM support\"\n    \nconfig PLATFORM_EC_CROS_BOARD_INFO_VIRTUAL\n    bool \"Virtual CBI support\"\n    \nendchoice\nendif",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 170,
        "startChar": 7,
        "endLine": 170,
        "endChar": 30
      },
